return.summary:
Read of the 17 learning, code and inquiry modules against the six frozen questions. Answers come from statements, docstrings and opening accounts. No proof was opened; four definitions were read in full (receive, broadenAfterFailure, reconsider, Answers).

In every module, what is registered is fixed, or changes only through something handed in:
- a map or reduction (Learnable, Readout, PartialReadout, Sensitivity);
- an adoption rule and an order of hearings (SharedCodes, CountedCodes);
- a code as the move of training (CodeAcquisition);
- a teacher and its lessons (ResponseLearning);
- slots received (LearnedGrouping);
- an enumeration of candidates (Learning).

Exact conditions for what can be acquired are stated as general laws: Learnable.learnable_iff, LearnableRuns.learnable_iff_tracks, CodeAcquisition.acquired_exact and step_installs, ResponseLearning.send_delivers and reconstructs_program, PartialReadout.exact_exists_iff. In each, the teacher, probes or samples are handed in.

Nearest to coming to register what was not registered:
- Learning.index_missed: the held candidate changes because of a miss, the course's own doing, but only within a supplied enumeration. Rest is only unrefuted and its step is not stated.
- Two built examples where a failure triggers more registering, with the response handed in: LearnedGrouping.broadening_after_failure (a supplied policy and supplied slots) and ResponseLearning.peer_repair (a supplied demonstration, then reconsider).
- SharedCodes.coin, the one step that makes a form, which is supplied with no cause. coined_returns brings a merged distinction back when the coined form is heard by all.

Loss is general and exact: SharedCodes.impose_loses_iff (by definition), held_stays and run_imposed_stays under every rule, resolved_alike_merged, no_reading_recovers, added_never_replaced, Readout.no_restore. A merged distinction comes back only from a form kept outside (outside_needed, outside_returns) or a coin.

Cost: stock is drawn per sample, per slot and per training step. Learning without stock is blocked or cut short, and a program is kept across generations only while each teacher holds at least 7 units. Stock is a precondition, never what is learned.

Feedback.lean states the gap without any change in what is registered: support follows only exchanges with what a formation depends on, and feedback carries nothing from beyond the influence closure (Clearing.uncoupled). No statement was found in which running down, or a loss of what the going-on rests on, causes a new registering.

return.guesses:
G1: this group gives no direct evidence, being outside the package. CorrectionInquiry, the one importer, reads refinement as handed in and as a case of commonResponse_antitone, which is consistent with G1.

G2: for it, FormedGrounds, ObservationChange and AlignmentInquiry supply the repertoire, the menu or the probe, with no tie to support. Against it, GoalFormationRevision registers the access loss of the agent's own practice (experience l.248-251). There, and in GoalRevision, the change of selector or rule is tied to the finite reserve, in built examples: unchanged_selection_exhausts_revised_practice l.435, and the reform gate on repeatBudget at l.251-264.

G3: for it, losses are unconditional within their models: closed_no_infinite, closed_step_spends, extension_invalidates, change_invalidates_records, no_finite_certificate_of_unrestricted_separation, absent_current_route_rejects. Acquisition is always conditional on fuel, Invariant, a schedule, responsiveness, authority or budget. Qualifying it, some losses are undone in built cases by re-handing in authority, a reference or a retest. The comparison with the future-reading asymmetry was not checked.

G4: supported. Exact acquisition conditions, by the model's own moves with the mechanism supplied:
- reachable_route_is_found (nodes ≤ fuel, inhabited);
- acquired_at_reach (every s, n);
- complete_records_identify_coupling (SoundRows, Complete);
- training_forms_decoder and every_reachable_faithful_interpretation_is_correct;
- acquired_history_identifies_origin (every c, r);
- query_cost_threshold (c < 1/8, built).
Each is a law of one supplied model or built; none is a general law over models.

G5: for it, every place hands in what drives the change: a schedule, a candidate, a menu, a meter, authority or responsiveness. ExpandingInquiry proves there is no finite last level. Nearest to against: what is registered is sometimes the effect of the thing itself (the practice's harm; a shared dependency's outage pattern). Only the timing is handed in. GoalRevision's reform gate on a forecast of the fund running out is built, with the demand handed in. No law was found in which the loss itself triggers the registering. So nothing is 'already there' in this group, and the read reports what is nearest.
